---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'

export const prerender = true

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'intro', text: '你好，我是良逍' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'what-i-do', text: '做过的一些产品' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'writing', text: '写作和学习' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'stack', text: '平时用的工具' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'contact', text: '联系我' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='关于我' {headings} view>
  <h2 id='intro'>你好，我是良逍</h2>
  <p>
    我是良逍，学的是设计，现在做产品经理。主业是跨境电商相关的 CMS、ERP 等后台系统，平时的工作会涉及内容配置、商品管理和业务流程。
  </p>
  <p>
    工作之外，我用 AI 做一些 iOS、macOS 和 Web 产品，也在尝试出海项目。以前主要做产品方案，现在也借助 AI 把想法做出来，再根据使用中遇到的问题继续修改。
  </p>
  <p>
    在其他平台上，我也用「良逍Ai出海」或「良逍Ai出海笔记」这个名字。这里放了我的一些产品、文章和学习记录。
  </p>

  <h2 id='what-i-do'>做过的一些产品</h2>
  <p>
    这些项目里，有 Apple 平台上的应用，也有浏览器扩展和网页工具。各个项目的进度不同，可以从下面的入口了解。
  </p>

  <div class='not-prose my-5 grid grid-cols-1 gap-3.5 sm:grid-cols-2'>
    {/* 1. PDF Snap：可点击卡片，指向隐私与支持主页（遵循 6px 微圆角矩形） */}
    <a
      href='/pdf-snap/privacy/'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        {/* 分类标签：采用 rounded-md 现代干练微圆角小矩形，告别胶囊 */}
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>iOS 工具</span>
        {/* 状态徽标：统一为 rounded-md 微圆角小矩形规范 */}
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>已上线 App Store</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>PDF Snap</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        在手机上合并、压缩、分割 PDF，也支持图片转 PDF。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>进入专区 →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    {/* 2. PhotoSpace：链接至项目矩阵 */}
    <a
      href='/projects'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>iOS 工具</span>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>持续迭代</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>PhotoSpace</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        查看相册占用的空间，整理手机里的照片。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>项目详情 →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    {/* 3. LIT：习惯记录工具 */}
    <a
      href='/projects'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>iOS 工具</span>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>持续迭代</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>LIT</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        记录日常习惯和生活中的小事。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>项目详情 →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    {/* 4. HeatSleuth：macOS 诊断工具，链接到官方单页 */}
    <a
      href='/heatsleuth/'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>macOS 应用</span>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>公开测试 · 可下载</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>HeatSleuth</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        查看 Mac 的资源占用，帮助排查发热和高负载的原因。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>产品主页 →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    {/* 5. OtterBar：macOS 菜单栏工具，链接到刚上线的官方产品单页 */}
    <a
      href='/otterbar/'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>macOS 应用</span>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>公开测试 · 可下载</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>OtterBar</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        搜索 Mac 菜单栏里的工具，尝试打开支持的应用入口。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>产品主页 →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    {/* 6. AdQuiet：YouTube 桌面端纯净扩展 */}
    <a
      href='/adquiet/'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>Chrome 扩展</span>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>Chrome Web Store</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>AdQuiet</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        减少 YouTube 桌面端观看视频时的广告打断。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>专区说明 →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    {/* 7. Mac 发票 OCR：离线财务开源工具 */}
    <a
      href='https://github.com/mrliang-github/cn-vat-invoice-ocr'
      target='_blank'
      rel='noopener noreferrer'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>开源工具</span>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>GitHub 开源</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>Mac 发票 OCR</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        在 Mac 本地识别发票，把结果整理成 Excel。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>开源仓库 ↗</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    {/* 8. MD 排版：微信公众号排版在线工具 */}
    <a
      href='https://md.liangxiaoaitool.top/'
      target='_blank'
      rel='noopener noreferrer'
      class='group hover-card-lift block rounded-md border border-border/70 p-4.5 transition-all hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-muted/30 no-underline'
    >
      <div class='flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-1.5'>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-medium text-primary'>Web 在线工具</span>
        <span class='rounded-md border border-border/60 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-normal text-muted-foreground'>公开可用</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class='text-sm font-semibold text-foreground transition-colors group-hover:text-primary'>MD 排版</h3>
      <p class='mt-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed line-clamp-2'>
        把 Markdown 排成可复制到微信公众号编辑器的文章。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-3 flex items-center justify-end text-xs font-medium text-primary opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity'>
        <span>立即使用 ↗</span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2 id='writing'>写作和学习</h2>
  <p>
    我会把做产品时用过的工具、遇到的问题和处理过程写下来。<a href='/blog'>博客</a>里主要是 AI 编程、产品设计和出海相关的文章，网站上也有<a href='/daily'>风向标整理</a>和<a href='/english'>英语学习记录</a>。
  </p>
  <p>
    我也在生财有术看项目案例、参与交流，做过一些志愿者工作。看到感兴趣的方向，会尝试做点东西，再记录过程中的发现。
  </p>

  <h2 id='stack'>平时用的工具</h2>
  <p>
    做产品和开发会用到 Codex、Claude Code、VS Code，也会用飞书多维表和 Google Sheets 整理资料。写作、设计方面，用过 Typora、Photoshop 和 Illustrator。日常使用 Mac 和 Chrome。
  </p>

  <h2 id='contact'>联系我</h2>
  <p>
    如果你也在用 AI 做产品，或想聊聊产品设计、出海项目和合作，可以通过下面的方式联系我。
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>微信联系</strong>：<code class='rounded-md border border-border/80 bg-muted/80 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-medium text-primary'>liangxiao-20</code>（添加时请备注来源与来意）
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>GitHub</strong>：<a href='https://github.com/mrliang-github' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>@mrliang-github</a>（代码和开源项目）
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>X (Twitter)</strong>：<a href='https://x.com/lingxio71220285' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer'>@lingxio71220285</a>（日常更新）
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>RSS 订阅</strong>：<a href='/rss.xml'>/rss.xml</a>（通过阅读器订阅文章与日报更新）
    </li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
